# Browser login to Thinkube apps (Thinkube platform default)

Thinkube apps sign in through Keycloak, realm `{{ keycloak_realm }}`. To
test an app in the Playwright MCP browser:

- Username: `{{ auth_realm_username }}`.
- Password: type the text `THINKUBE_PASSWORD` into the password field
  with browser_type or browser_fill_form. The Playwright MCP types the
  real password and shows it as <secret>THINKUBE_PASSWORD</secret> in
  its output.
- Never read the password from a file or variable, and never write it in
  a tool call, a file or a message.
- Never create or change Keycloak users to get a login.
- If the login fails, report the message the page shows and stop.
